{"headword":"כֶּ֫שֶׂב","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>lamb (</strong>transp. from preceding<strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">כ׳</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.7\">Lv 3:7</a> + 5 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּשָׂבִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a> + 6 times;—<em>lamb</em>, as property <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:32\" href=\"/Genesis.30.32\">Gn 30:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:33\" href=\"/Genesis.30.33\">33</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:35\" href=\"/Genesis.30.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:40\" href=\"/Genesis.30.40\">40</a> (J); for sacrif. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 1:10\" href=\"/Leviticus.1.10\">Lv 1:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 3:7\" href=\"/Leviticus.3.7\">3:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 4:35\" href=\"/Leviticus.4.35\">4:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:19\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.19\">22:19</a> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:17\" href=\"/Numbers.18.17\">Nu 18:17</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 22:27\" href=\"/Leviticus.22.27\">Lv 22:27</a>; for food <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 7:23\" href=\"/Leviticus.7.23\">Lv 7:23</a>, cf. <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:3\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.3\">17:3</a> (all P); <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.4\">Dt 14:4</a>."}]},"rid":"BDB04372","strong_numbers":["3775"],"next_hw":"כִּשְׂבָּה","prev_hw":"כִּבְשָׂה","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["4166"],"TWOT":["949"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}